5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to get started! I really want to make sure we're spending our budget wisely this time. Let's pick some things to investigate!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that budget is important, Mio. However, we should also consider the practical capacity of our team to execute these plans. I'll start by looking into the composition of the volunteer roster.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Budget and staffing are the obvious choices, but they're superficial. I'm more interested in what actually draws a crowd. I'll look into the weekend head counts across ten seasons and five years of visitor comment slips.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that we need a balanced perspective. However, we must ensure the physical space can actually support the exhibition. I will look into the structural survey of the suspended bay and the maintenance log for powered displays.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely to see everyone so enthusiastic. I want to make sure our guests have a smooth experience without any disappointments. I will look into the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the loan transport costs.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Since everyone is covering the logistics and the crowds, I'll dig into the hidden costs! I want to see the mount-making charges and joiner's rate, and the conservation lab staffing and backlog. Let's find those leaks!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"It seems we have a comprehensive list forming. To complement my interest in the volunteer roster, I will also look into the conservation lab staffing and backlog. I want to understand our current operational limits.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, you're quite focused on the staff. While that's safe, it doesn't tell us if the exhibition will actually be a success. I'll stick with my choices; the data on visitors is far more telling.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, popularity is irrelevant if the building cannot physically sustain the installation. I believe my focus on the structural integrity and power systems is the most critical priority for the gallery's longevity.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is wonderful that we are all looking at this from such different, important angles. I believe our combined efforts will ensure a lovely experience for everyone. I am quite content with my choices.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm glad we're all on the same page! I'll stick with my choices. I really want to see where the money goes before we commit to a big project. I'm ready for the results!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will also remain with my selections. Understanding the gap between our planned ambitions and our actual human resources is essential for a sustainable exhibition. I look forward to seeing what the data reveals.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, @Victoria, your focus on the ""how"" is tedious. I'm interested in the ""why."" I'll maintain my focus on the visitor data. It's the only metric that truly matters in the end.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, the ""why"" is meaningless if the ""how"" results in a structural failure. I will maintain my focus on the survey and the maintenance log. I am ready to proceed.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I think it is quite refreshing to see such passion from all of you. I shall keep my choices as they are. I look forward to seeing what we discover together.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm just so curious to see if those mount-making costs are as crazy as I think they are! I'm all set and super ready to see the results! Let's do this!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I am also ready. I believe that by examining our staffing and volunteer capacity, we can avoid placing an undue burden on our team. I look forward to the findings.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,1,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, you've already spoken twice. How clumsy. As for the rest of you, your obsession with the mundane is almost endearing. I'm ready to see if the numbers agree with my intuition.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I have no need for further discussion on this matter. My choices are final, and I am ready to review the data regarding the building's capacity.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,1,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to see such a spirited discussion. I shall also say over, and I look forward to seeing how our findings can help us make a wonderful choice.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
28,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
