39,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, you guys! I found out that bespoke mount-making is charged per object and the joiner's rate has jumped by half! That's a huge hidden cost if we don't have supports already!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"That is concerning, Mio. My findings are equally worrying; the conservation lab is down to a single staff member with a backlog of two hundred pieces. We are severely understaffed for any ambitious project.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,1,talk,Shion,,"It seems we are all discovering how broken the system is. However, the data shows that static displays are failures. People don't return for cased objects; they return for movement and human interaction.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, your desire for movement is dangerous. The maintenance log shows seventeen call-outs last season, with several failures during opening hours. Our power systems are already unstable and cannot handle more stress.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"It seems we have many challenges to consider. I found that our shipping cut-offs have been missed twice recently, and transport costs are quite high. We must be very careful with our delivery schedules.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, @Shizue, it sounds like we're in a real pinch! Between the joiner's rates and the shipping costs, we could go broke before the show even opens! We definitely need a proposal that's simple and budget-friendly.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, simplicity is a necessity, but we must also consider the human cost. With the conservation lab in such a state, any proposal requiring extensive stabilization or cleaning will be impossible to execute.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, you're treating the museum like a hospital for objects. It's a gallery for people. If we prioritize ""simplicity"" and ""safety,"" we'll just produce another sterile, forgotten exhibition that no one bothers to revisit.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, a ""sterile"" exhibition is preferable to one that causes a structural failure. The suspended bay is capped at four hundred kilos per square metre; we cannot afford heavy installations or unstable machinery.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, I understand your desire to excite our guests, but we must be mindful. If we promise a grand opening and the pieces arrive late, it would be such a shame to disappoint everyone.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shion, I get that you want it to be exciting, but we can't have a ""success"" if we're bankrupt or the ceiling falls! Let's look for something that's flashy but easy on the wallet and the staff!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, ""flashy"" often requires the very labor we lack. We cannot ignore that one person is managing a backlog of two hundred pieces. We must prioritize a proposal that requires minimal conservation and installation work.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, your fear of work is stifling. The data is clear: people crave life and interaction. If we choose a ""minimal"" show, we are simply choosing to be irrelevant. We need a catalyst, not a compromise.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, your ""catalyst"" is a liability. We have already had to shore up the bay for stonework and reroute deliveries. We cannot ignore the physical limits of the building for the sake of a trend.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, your passion is truly admirable, but perhaps we can find a way to be exciting without being risky. Let us be kind to our staff and our building so we can welcome everyone with a smile.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mio,,"Exactly! Let's find a middle ground! If we pick a show where the objects come with their own supports, we save a ton of money and stress. I'm ready to see the candidates!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. We must be realistic about our capacity. A proposal that minimizes the burden on the conservation lab and our limited staff is the only responsible choice. I am ready to see the candidates.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, @Victoria, your ""middle ground"" is just a slow death by boredom. I'll be looking for the candidate that actually understands the audience. Let's see if any of these proposals have a pulse. I'm ready.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I will be looking for a proposal that respects the physical constraints of the gallery. We cannot risk further structural strain or power failures. I am ready to review the candidates.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree with you all. Let us hope we find a proposal that is both wonderful for our guests and gentle on our hardworking team. I am ready to see the candidates.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
